.TH JULES-MANAGER 1 "March 2026" "jules-vanager 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
jules-manager \- Google Jules API session and repository manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B jules-manager
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B jules-manager
provides command-line control over Google Jules asynchronous coding tasks, connected repositories, session logs, and messaging.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list-sources
List connected repositories and sources.
.TP
.B list-sessions
List active or completed Jules sessions.
.TP
.B start-session \fR(or \fBstart\fR)
Start a new Jules task session in a target repository with a provided prompt.
.TP
.B get-activities
Retrieve real-time event logs, activity entries, and tool calls for a session.
.TP
.B send-message
Send an answer or message to an active Jules session prompt.
.TP
.B archive-session
Archive an existing session.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show summary of options and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR jules-listener (1),
.BR jules-tui (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Maintained by Vikyek <https://github.com/Vikyek>.
